# Architecture

This app uses a strict layered architecture. Never bypass layers.

```
Page / API route  →  Service  →  Repository  →  Mongoose Model
                         ↓
                    Serializer (DTO shaping)
```

## Layer rules

- **Pages & API routes** are orchestration only — no business logic, no direct Mongoose calls.
- **Services** (`src/lib/services/*.service.ts`) contain business logic, validation, and transactions.
- **Repositories** (`src/lib/repositories/*.repository.ts`) handle persistence only — no cross-domain rules.
- **Serializers** (`src/lib/serializers/`) shape DTOs for the UI — reuse across pages and APIs.
- **Validators** (`src/lib/validators/`) define Zod schemas — parse in API routes and services.

## Export pattern

Services and repositories export **plain objects**, not classes:

```typescript
// ✅ GOOD
export const beatService = { async create(...) { ... } };

// ❌ BAD
export class BeatService { ... }
```

## Feature code

Keep shared feature code under `src/features/`:
- `src/features/beats/` — beat-pack UI types, shared beat logic
- `src/features/payments/` — payment-related shared code
- `src/features/studio/` — producer dashboard components

Generic UI primitives go in `src/components/ui/`; app shell in `src/components/layout/`.
